---
import ProtocolLayout from "../layouts/ProtocolLayout.astro";
import LegalArticle from "../components/LegalArticle.astro";
---

<ProtocolLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Metabolic Molly · WholeHearted"
  description="How Metabolic Molly (WholeHearted) collects, uses, and protects your information, including mobile numbers and text message consent."
  index={true}
>
  <LegalArticle heading="Privacy Policy" updated="November 20, 2026">
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>WholeHearted</strong>, doing business as <strong>Metabolic Molly</strong>
      (Molly Broad, 1671 Big Bear Dr., Centerville, OH 45458) ("we," "us," or "our"), collects, uses, and protects
      information when you visit metabolicmolly.com or wholehearted.live, message us on Facebook, Instagram, TikTok,
      or our website chat, receive our emails, or opt in to our text messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> your name, email address, mobile phone number, and anything you choose to share in a message, such as your main health or wellness goal.</li>
      <li><strong>Messages:</strong> the content of conversations with us on social media, website chat, email, and text.</li>
      <li><strong>Website and email data:</strong> basic usage information such as pages visited, links clicked, device and browser type, collected through cookies and similar tools.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not ask for, and you should not send us, medical records, payment card numbers, or government ID numbers.</p>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To answer your questions and send the information you ask for.</li>
      <li>To send emails and, if you opt in, text messages with reminders, tips, event invitations, and updates.</li>
      <li>To help you get started after you place an order.</li>
      <li>To improve our website, messages, and service.</li>
      <li>To follow the law and protect our rights.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Text messaging (SMS) and mobile information</h2>
    <p>
      If you give us your mobile number and agree to receive texts, we use it only to send the messages described in our
      <a href="/sms-terms/">SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</a>. Consent to receive texts is never a condition of purchase.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong>
      All of the categories of sharing described in this policy exclude text messaging originator opt-in data and consent;
      this information will not be shared with any third parties.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can opt out of texts at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help,
      or email <a href="mailto:molly@metabolicmolly.com">molly@metabolicmolly.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>How we share information</h2>
    <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We share it only:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>With service providers that help us run our business, such as our customer relationship and messaging platform (GoHighLevel / LeadConnector), email provider (Google Workspace), and website host. They may use it only to provide services to us.</li>
      <li>When required by law, or to protect the rights, safety, or property of us or others.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Products are ordered and shipped by Unicity International through Unicity's own website. Information you give
      Unicity when you order is covered by Unicity's privacy policy, not this one.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>
      Our website uses cookies and similar tools, including GoHighLevel tracking and chat, and embedded YouTube videos,
      to understand visits and run the chat window. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings; some features may not work without them.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>Every marketing email includes an unsubscribe link. You can also email us to be removed.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
    <p>We keep information only as long as needed for the purposes above, or as the law requires, and then delete it.</p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information. No method of sending or storing data is completely secure.</p>

    <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask to see, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you by emailing
      <a href="mailto:molly@metabolicmolly.com">molly@metabolicmolly.com</a>. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under local law.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Our website and messages are meant for adults 18 and older. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      WholeHearted (Metabolic Molly)<br />
      1671 Big Bear Dr., Centerville, OH 45458<br />
      <a href="mailto:molly@metabolicmolly.com">molly@metabolicmolly.com</a> · <a href="tel:5136506639">(513) 650-6639</a>
    </p>
  </LegalArticle>
</ProtocolLayout>
